### Import threading primitives used by details refreshes

**Severity:** `medium`

The rich-content refresh path needs atomic generation and cleanup checks so stale background refreshes cannot repopulate the details pane after a newer update or teardown. Import the threading APIs used by those guards.

```suggestion
using System.Collections.ObjectModel;
using System.Threading;
using Microsoft.CmdPal.UI.ViewModels.Models;
using Microsoft.CommandPalette.Extensions;
using Microsoft.CommandPalette.Extensions.Toolkit;
```

